libmath.go adapts these algorithms above the ARM exp and log implementation.
Polynomial grouping and explicit FMA reproduce the reference's evaluation.
Source: https://netlib.org/fdlibm/

The LGPL trigonometric implementations are outside this repository.
Hosts can supply them through Options.Math without a production dependency.

